  "concept": {
    "zh": "货物转移 · 动态门 · 双机追堵",
    "en": "Cargo transfers · Changing gates · Two rivals"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "26 回合内取走两块电池并撤离。石墨号追向芽芽，铜线号靠近出口巡逻。第 4、9、13 回合结束后门会切换，未收走的电池会转移。有机器人或电池占住的门当次保持开启。和对手同格或迎面换位会被抓。从容模式下，同一份程序须通过 2 张地图。",
    "en": "Collect both batteries and escape in 26 turns. Graphite pursues Sprout, and Copperwire patrols near the exit. Gates switch and unclaimed batteries relocate after turns 4, 9, and 13. A gate stays open for that shift if occupied by a robot or battery. Sharing a tile or swapping positions head-on with a rival gets you caught. In Relaxed mode, one program must win on all 2 maps."
  },
